  "_scale": "NOT rescaled, deliberately, alongside Speedball. Dustline, Woods and Holdfast went to 88% on 2026-09-07; this field was taken there and then brought back. Measured with tools/probe-trading at squad size 12: at full size Urban punishes trading by +2.67 deaths, and at 88% that inverts to -0.33 -- trading becomes marginally SAFER than holding an angle, which is the opposite of what the market quarter is for. Two of five fields turn out not to survive a shrink while the squad doubles. Re-run the probe before shrinking this one again."
